# Tempest Angler: "Whenever you cast a noncreature spell, put a +1/+1 counter on this creature." Hybrid {U/R}{U/R} is paid with a blue
# and a red mana (CR 107.4e). After the Angler is on the battlefield: Bot1's Ornithopter (a creature spell, an artifact one) gives
# nothing, Bot1's Mox Pearl (a noncreature artifact spell) gives one counter, Bot2's Mox cast in Bot2's turn gives nothing (it is
# not Bot1's spell), and on turn 3 Bot1's Lightning Bolt (an instant) gives the second. The trigger counts only casts made while the
# Angler is on the battlefield, so the Moxen cast before it are not counted.

[Bot1 Deck]
Tempest Angler
Mox Ruby
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Ornithopter
Mox Pearl
Lightning Bolt
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Island x20

